description:
Come along to the Beach Haven Playcentre Garage and Bake Sale!&nbsp;
Mark your calendars, whānau! Join us for a fun-filled fundraising day!
Everything $1 – yes, you read that right! Browse through a treasure trove of donated garage sale items, all just one dollar each.&nbsp;Treat yourself to some delicious homemade baked goodies made with love.&nbsp;
All proceeds go directly back to our fundraising efforts, supporting our local tamariki and whānau.&nbsp;
A huge thank you to our wonderful friends at Birkdale Beach Haven Community Project for making this possible.
See you there! &nbsp;
